/node_modules
/.tmp
/.claude/worktrees
/analyzer/.claude/worktrees

# Generated test reports. Everything under docs/test-coverage/ is produced by test.bat;
# only the scenario summary is committed, because it is the one artefact worth reviewing
# in a diff — it shows which specified scenarios gained or lost a test.
/docs/test-coverage/*
!/docs/test-coverage/scenarios.md

# Per-run test output
**/TestResults/
/FE/test-results/
/FE/playwright-report/
